spec ro02-read-view-before-two-writers: 3 sessions, 90 permutations
# RO02. s1 and s2 BEGIN; s3 then opens a read-only transaction. s1 writes x and s2
# writes y, each committing; s3 reads both. s3 sees neither write in any
# interleaving: both commit after its snapshot was taken. The final read, at a new
# snapshot, sees both.

starting permutation: s1w s1c s2w s2c s3r s3c
step s1w: MATCH (n:Item {name:'x'}) SET n.v = 1 RETURN n.v AS v
v
